since|PASS: Time-preposition, temporal-clause, standalone-from-then and reason-clause uses are distinct; shop chronology, closed entrance, visits and occupied hall all translate coherently.
whatever|PASS: Whatever fabric takes a noun and whatever remains stands alone; unrestricted choice versus residual objects matches Vietnamese and is not mislabeled as indifference.
commonly|PASS: Frequency or widespread use is not universal use; clay-tool participle and thường translation fit the adverb with no approved frequency statistic.
fiery|REVIEW: [SENSE_BOUNDARY] Emotional intensity example is accurate but the 4600 evidence directly describes burning; literal-fire coverage is missing and must not be silently called exhaustive.
junior|PASS: Rank/experience and younger-participant boundaries differ; engineer example avoids equating rank with age and chess age limits remain organization dependent.
